# The example fixtures must ship: `launchreel build examples/self --offline` is the first thing
# anyone runs, and it fails without them. Re-included explicitly because common global ignores
# (*.cache, Music/) would otherwise drop them silently.
!examples/*/launchreel-cache/
!examples/*/launchreel-cache/**
